    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "What is “Tischtennis”?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "It’s fine if you have no idea. But Fan Zhendong, the Chinese table tennis superstar, knows the word very well now. “Tischtennis” means “table tennis” in German. These days, Fan even greets journalists with “Guten Tag” instead of “Da Jia Hao”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "It’s not surprising that Fan is picking up German—when in Germany, speak as the Germans speak. The Olympic champion has joined 1. FC Saarbrücken-Tischtennis. This German table tennis club is one of the strongest in Europe. For the 2025-26 season, Fan will "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "compete",
            "ref": "v-compete"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with his new teammates in the Tischtennis-Bundesliga (TTBL, 德国乒乓球甲级联赛), the German Cup, and the Champions League."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many fans see Fan as a leader of China’s new "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "generation",
            "ref": "v-generation"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of table tennis players. But the star isn’t just "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "content",
            "ref": "v-content"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to rest at the top of his sport. Instead, he says he is “looking forward to more challenges”. That’s why he set off on a new journey in Germany. It takes real courage for a top player like him to make such a decision."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Moving to foreign soil is no walk in the park. Language is only the first "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "hurdle",
            "zh": "障碍"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Fan also needs to get used to the tables, the balls, and the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "opponents",
            "zh": "对手"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Everything feels a bit different from back home in China. On his TTBL "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "debut",
            "zh": "首次亮相"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on August 31, 2025, he even lost both of his matches. Fortunately, he soon seemed to hit his stride. On his second matchday, September 7, he helped his team secure its first victory of the season, and one week later, its first home win."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Are you a fan of Fan? Would you follow his example and challenge yourself with something new? Perhaps you’re memorising new words, studying new subjects, and getting used to new teachers as a new school year begins. You might feel like a fish out of water at first. But, just as Fan’s new opponents will "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sharpen",
            "ref": "v-sharpen"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " his skills, your challenges will shape you into a stronger, wiser person."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "As Fan continues to explore his new world, remind yourself not to fear the challenges in your own life. See them as stepping stones on your own path to growth."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
